\tag{fdip}
\title{Right actions and coupled components}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{A cochain with Hurwitz coefficients has an exterior factor
and a quaternion factor. Right multiplication can act on either
one. Which of these actions commutes with every link assignment,
and what component information follows from an actual
decomposition? The smallest periodic cells already distinguish
the two factors.}

